---
// GoogleBusinessProfile.astro - UK specific section mentioning GBP as optional add-on
---

<section class="py-20 bg-bg-elevated relative section-fade-in">
  <!-- Gradient divider -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-accent-secondary/50 to-transparent"></div>
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-heading text-text-primary mb-6">
          Google Business Profile setup
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-text-secondary mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          A Google Business Profile helps local customers find you when they search for services in your area.
        </p>
        <p class="text-text-secondary mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          This is an optional add-on that can be discussed after we've had an initial conversation about your needs. It's not included by default, but it's something many of our clients find valuable as part of their wider growth system.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-primary mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-text-secondary">Appear in Google Maps results for your area</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-primary mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-text-secondary">Display opening hours, photos, and reviews</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-primary mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-text-secondary">Make it easy for customers to call or get directions</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent-primary mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-text-secondary">Works alongside your website for maximum visibility</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-tertiary">
          Get in touch to discuss whether Google Business Profile is right for your business.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="glass rounded-xl p-8">
        <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-surface rounded-lg overflow-hidden relative">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-primary/10 to-accent-secondary/10 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-24 h-24 text-accent-primary/30" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M22.56 12.25c0-.78-.07-1.53-.2-2.25H12v4.26h5.92c-.26 1.37-1.04 2.53-2.21 3.31v2.77h3.57c2.08-1.92 3.28-4.74 3.28-8.09z"/>
              <path d="M12 23c2.97 0 5.46-.98 7.28-2.66l-3.57-2.77c-.98.66-2.23 1.06-3.71 1.06-2.86 0-5.29-1.93-6.16-4.53H2.18v2.84C3.99 20.53 7.7 23 12 23z"/>
              <path d="M5.84 14.09c-.22-.66-.35-1.36-.35-2.09s.13-1.43.35-2.09V7.07H2.18C1.43 8.55 1 10.22 1 12s.43 3.45 1.18 4.93l2.85-2.22.81-.62z"/>
              <path d="M12 5.38c1.62 0 3.06.56 4.21 1.64l3.15-3.15C17.45 2.09 14.97 1 12 1 7.7 1 3.99 3.47 2.18 7.07l3.66 2.84c.87-2.6 3.3-4.53 6.16-4.53z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 text-center">
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">
            Part of the wider growth system — discussed after initial contact
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
